  External SERVICE CONTAINER used ONLY by CI's live-postgres job to obtain a
  pgAudit-capable Postgres server for
  packages/ne-audit/tests/test_pgaudit_live.py. NOT embedded, NOT
  distributed with this package, and NEVER part of a shipped deployment
  profile — production deployments configure their own pgAudit-capable
  Postgres via `shared_preload_libraries='pgaudit'`. Chosen over
